    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32307" root="غلم" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُلُومَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُلُومِيَّةٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُلَامِيَّةٌ</span></b>  (K)
The <i>state,</i> or <i>condition, of such as is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُلَام</span>:
(S, K: *) the second is expl. by Mohammad Ibn-
Habeeb as meaning the <i>period from birth to the
seventeenth year.</i> (TA voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبَابٌ</span>.)

